CORRECTNESS RESULTS (run 2026-08-10 on this branch, base b700489)
  766/766 PASS + 2 SKIP at threads=1 AND threads=8, no --skip-group.
  Set-diff BY NAME, key=(group,name), value=(status, ACTUAL md5), against
