  forbid(unsafe_code) proven ACTIVE, not read: an `unsafe { transmute }` planted
  in src/loopfilter.rs made `cargo build --release --lib` fail with
  "error: usage of an `unsafe` block" pointing at
  `#![cfg_attr(not(asm_loopfilter), forbid(unsafe_code))]`. Restored from a
