  8c1ddc8543550edbe586f1ca10a460a2a9daef5f0931c2a0b3870340b55b86ed before and
  after, plus `git diff --exit-code -- src lib.rs include crates` clean.

A PROFILE ATTEMPT THAT FAILED, RECORDED SO IT IS NOT REPEATED
  ~/tmp/tiledprof/prof_spin/: four `sample` runs of bench_ivf_limit under
  RAV1D_INLOOP={all,nodeblock} at t=8, intended to show the spin
  redistribution symbol by symbol. All four report outlived_window=0 and
  produced NO .sample file: bench_ivf_limit stops at end of stream (200 frames
  = 0.66 s at t=8, 16 frames = 0.5 s at 4K), far short of the 25 s window, and
  it has no repeat loop. The aggregate test in tiled_inloop2_* answers the same
  question; a symbol-level version needs a repeat loop in that driver.
